    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional New Home Nearing Completion \r\nAn exciting opportunity to acquire a beautifully designed new home, currently nearing completion, in the peaceful and highly desirable Ballinlug, Killanne area of Enniscorthy, Co. Wexford. Set in a wonderful rural location, the property enjoys fantastic panoramic views, offering a tranquil countryside setting while remaining within easy reach of local amenities and Enniscorthy.\r\nThe house has been constructed to a very high standard, with great attention to detail throughout. A small portion of construction is left to be complete, kitchen/Sunroom area. The property offers the opportunity for a new owner to put the finishing touches to a superb home and make it their own.\r\nArrange a viewing today to appreciate the setting, views, workmanship and full potential of this impressive home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: 2.9 x 2 – Feature front door, laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights.\r\n\r\nInner hall: 11.62 x 2 – Laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights, staircase to first floor.\r\n \r\nLiving room: 5.7 X 4.5 – Laminated wooden floor, solid fuel stove, recess ceiling lights, 2 windows.\r\n   \r\nTemporary Kitchen: 2.3 x 4 - Lino floor, fitted kitchen eye and waist level units, oven/hob extractor fan, plumbed for washing machine. \r\n \r\nPlanned Kitchen: 10 x 6.5 – Chimney breast, plumbed for appliances, open plan to Sunroom\r\n\r\nSunroom: 4.4 x 4.2 – Double doors to front of house\r\n\r\nUtility: 2.9 x 2 – Back door\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.9 x 6 – Laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights\r\n\r\nWalk in wardrobe: 2.4 x 2.4\r\n\r\nEn - suite: 2.4 x 1.5 – WC, WHB, Plumbed for shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3.9 x 3.9 – Laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights\r\n \r\nBedroom 4: 3.9 x 3.9 – Laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights\r\n    \r\nBedroom 5: 4.1 x 4 – Laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights, door to rear\r\n \r\nEn - suite: 1.6 x 1.55 – WC, WHB\r\n\r\nStore room: 1.6 x 2.2 – \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 10.1 x 6.1 – Laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights, Velux windows\r\n\r\nMaster ensuite: 3.7 x 3 – Tiled Floor, tiled walls, recess ceiling lights, Velux window, WC, WHB, bath, towel rail, feature free standing shower unit.       \r\n\r\nLanding area: 4.8 x 4\t- Laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights \r\n\r\nStore Room: 10 x 2.7 – Laminated wooden floor, recess ceiling lights"
      },
